Operator guide: .brigada/operator.md tells your own coding agent how to work
  with brigada; have it read that file.
  In the background: a runner starts now and keeps going (log:
    ~/.local/state/brigada/runner.log; stop it with: brigada stop). The engine
    starts when needed and stops after 30 idle minutes.

